# Validation example: LiH, 6-31G, GNOF, FULL_OPTIMIZATION TRUE, USE_RI TRUE, both
# NON_RELATIVISTIC and X2C (same molecule run twice, as in lih_gnof_full_optimization.inp).
# Confirms USE_RI's extension to NON_REL/X2C's FULL_OPTIMIZATION (not just SCF):
# compare the two FULL_OPTIMIZATION final total energies against lih_gnof_full_optimization.inp's
# own dense ones -- NON_REL: -7.997608947 Hartree (matches to displayed precision for this
# PAUTO aux basis); X2C: -7.999383262 Hartree dense vs ~-7.999383130 Hartree here (~1.3e-7
# Hartree, USE_RI's expected approximation level).
NELEC 4
BASIS lih-6-31g.gbs
NON_RELATIVISTIC TRUE
X2C TRUE
FUNCTIONAL GNOF
PNOF_SUBSPACES 2
PNOF_COUPLING 2
FULL_OPTIMIZATION TRUE
USE_RI TRUE

GEOMETRY
Li  0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.000000   1.594900
END
